PoolNet repository licensing
============================

This repository combines two independently licensed projects. The root license
is composite; the full text for each component lives beside its code.

hub/ — GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later
------------------------------------------------------------
The hub control plane (server, tests, scripts, deployment templates, and the
public site under web/site) is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version (AGPL-3.0-or-later).

Full license text: hub/LICENSE
SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later

pool/ — MIT License
-------------------
The proxy-pool engine is licensed under the MIT License.

Full license text: pool/LICENSE
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Documentation and third-party material
--------------------------------------
Files under docs/ document the combined project and follow the license of the
component they describe. Font files and other third-party assets keep their own
licenses; see NOTICE and docs/THIRD-PARTY.md. If an individual file carries a
license header, that header applies to that file.

Copyright (C) 2026 PoolNet contributors.
